[180.125, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u273b\u001b[3GCogitated for 3m 1s \u00b7 done 3:42 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mProfile this implementation on the supplied development workloads. Improve performance within the same rules and \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mremaining budget. Preserve the interface and correctness requirements. Do not use hidden evaluation inputs, external \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mimplementations or other ports. Record profiling evidence, changes, tests and remaining limitations in NOTES.md.\u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMatmuls are ~12.4 ms\u001b[24Gof\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31G13.5\u001b[36Gms\u001b[39Gforward,\u001b[48Gall\u001b[52Grunning\u001b[60Gat\u001b[63G~35\u001b[67GGB/s\u001b[72Gregardless\u001b[83Gof\u001b[86Glayout.\u001b[94GLet\u001b[98Gme\u001b[101Gcheck\u001b[107Gwhether\u001b[115Gthat's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gmemory\u001b[14Gceiling\u001b[22Gor\u001b[25Ga\u001b[27GBLAS-kernel\u001b[39Glimit.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;0;0;"]
[180.126, "0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNumPy's own SIMD loops beat\u001b[31GAccelerate's\u001b[44Gsg\u001b[47Gmv\u001b[50Gon\u001b[53Gthese\u001b[59Gtransposed\u001b[70Gweights,\u001b[79Gat\u001b[82Gabout\u001b[88G48\u001b[91GGB/s\u001b[96Gagainst\u001b[104G36\u001b[107GGB/s,\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[1B  accumulation order matches the reference loop. I'm checking all the real shapes next.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mvecdot\u001b[39m reaches about 43\u201347 GB/s with no layout change or extra load cost, and its error is close to gemv's while\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B transposed einsum's\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26G5\u20137\u00d7\u001b[31Glarger.\u001b[39GNext\u001b[44GI'll\u001b[49Gmeasure\u001b[57Gnon-matmul\u001b[68Goverhead\u001b[77Gat\u001b[80Gshort\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Glong\u001b[95Gcontexts.\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell com\u001b[20Gnd \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[39m Attent\u001b[10Gon is already near memory speed (~120\u001b[48G\u00b5\u001b[50G/layer at 1,024 positions)\u001b[77G The changes to make are \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mvecdot\u001b[39m for\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B matvecs, plus less per-op overhead i"]
[180.127, "n RoPE, SwiGLU and\u001b[58Grmsnorm. Editing \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mrun.py\u001b[39m:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u23fa\u001b[39m Fixing names, benchmarking,\u001b[31Grunning full check\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m  \u23bf  $ sed -i '' -e 's/reshape(n_kv_heads, kv_mul, hs)/reshape(n_kv_heads, self.kv_mul, hs)/' -e 's/self.inv_dim = \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B    \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mF32(dim)/self.fdim = F32(dim)/' -e 's/fdim, sqrt_hs = self.one, self.eps, self.inv_dim, self.sqrt_hs/fdim, sqrt_hs \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B= self.one, self.eps, self.fdim, self.sqrt_hs/' run.py && grep -n \"fdim\\|k\u2026\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u2722\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mZigzagging\u2026 \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m(2m 50s \u00b7 \u2193\u001b[27G13.1k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Use /btw to ask a quick side question without interrupting Claude's current work\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B                             \u001b[37G        \u001b[103G\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u25cf high \u00b7 /effort\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;138;138;138m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
